# The Foundation Piles (CIPlay foundation_piles), STORY 10-24: the mudflat, Nell Abernethy's note, the engineers' forged
# survey, the excavator's ballast sheets, the pile drivers' cave and stash, the rubble bank, down Ines's hooks to the
# first pile and its jack log, the first two jacks, the pile stingray in two phases, the third jack and its log, Crane's
# last page by the fourth air pocket, the fourth jack, Ines's closing note, back to the mudflat; the treasure.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island The Foundation Piles
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Piles
expect hidden closing
zone mudflat
expect step 1
read Nell Abernethy's note
expect step 2
read Engineers' survey
expect step 3
open Excavator's toolbox
wait 3
expect step 4
zone driver_cave
expect step 5
open Pile-driver's stash
wait 3
expect step 6
zone rubble_bank
expect step 7
zone pile_1
air pile_1
expect step 8
read Jack log - pile 1
expect step 9
use jack1
expect story jack1 1
expect step 10
zone pile_2
expect step 11
use jack3
expect story jack3 0
use jack2
expect story jack2 1
expect step 12
# (a play's kill skips the phase: on.defeat gives both story items)
kill Stingray
wait 3
expect story rayhurt 1
expect story raydown 1
expect step 14
use jack3
expect story jack3 1
expect step 15
read Jack log - pile 3
expect step 16
read Aldous Crane's last page
expect step 17
use jack4
expect shown closing
expect story jack4 1
expect step 18
read The city holds
expect step 19
zone mudflat_return
expect done
# the optional Hump and pump gallery: their boxes still open, with their messages
open Pile-driver's derrick deck box
wait 3
open Pump gallery strongbox
wait 3
dig
